<title>RUSSIA: Rouble higher at 5,397 per dlr in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble higher at 5,397 per dlr in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble edged up to 5,397 to the dollar on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange (MICEX) from 5,399 on Thursday.</p>
<p>				    Sept 20		 Sept 19</p>
<p> Dollar rate		    5,397		   5,399</p>
<p> Volume traded (mln $)	5.48		    27.66</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
